sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.leaves.show)"
    participant Controller as "Employee LeaveController"
    participant Model as "LeaveRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Klik detail pengajuan cuti
    View->>Controller: GET /employee/leaves/{id}
    Controller->>Model: getById(id) + validasi kepemilikan
    Model->>DB: SELECT leave_request + leave_type + approver
    DB-->>Model: Data detail cuti
    Model-->>Controller: Entitas pengajuan cuti

    alt Data valid (id milik pegawai login)
        Controller->>View: Render halaman detail cuti
        View-->>Pegawai: Detail cuti tampil
    else Data tidak valid (id tidak ada/tidak berhak akses)
        Controller->>View: 403/redirect + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal melihat detail
    end
